ble-content\"> (Can go through wood portal?)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Yes</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Cooked deer meat</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/b/bc/Cooked_deer_meat.png/revision/latest?cb=20210922034153\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Cooked deer meat\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/b/bc/Cooked_deer_meat.png/revision/latest?cb=20210922034153\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/b/bc/Cooked_deer_meat.png/revision/latest?cb=20210922034153 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/b/bc/Cooked_deer_meat.png/revision/latest?cb=20210922034153 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Cooked deer meat\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" data-image-key=\"Cooked_deer_meat.png\" data-image-name=\"Cooked deer meat.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i>All that running paid off.</i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Food</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Internal ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">CookedDeerMeat</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cooking_station\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cooking station\">Cooking station</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Crafting, Eating</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">Weight</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">Stack</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">1.0</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">20</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"teleport\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle toccolours\" style=\"float: none;\"><span title=\"Can go through wood portal?\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom:2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color)\">Teleportable</span></span></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"> (Can go through wood portal?)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Yes</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Crafting Materials</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Deer_meat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deer meat\">Deer meat</a> x1</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Effects</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"health\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Max Health</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">35</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stamina\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Max Stamina</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"duration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Duration</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color);\" title=\"1200s\">20m</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"healing\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Healing</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 hp/tick</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Deer meat</b> is a basic food obtained by killing <a href=\"/wiki/Deer\" title=\"Deer\">Deer</a>.\n</p><p>It can be cooked on a <a href=\"/wiki/Cooking_station\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cooking station\">Cooking station</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_cooking_station\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Iron cooking station\">Iron cooking station</a> to obtain <b>Cooked deer meat</b>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a> if overcooked.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Availability\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Availability</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Crafting\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Crafting</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#For_Deer_meat\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">For Deer meat</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#For_Cooked_deer_meat\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">For Cooked deer meat</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Availability\">Availability</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeer_Meat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" width=\"50%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"40%\">Creature</th>\n<th width=\"20%\">0 Star</th>\n<th width=\"20%\">1 Star</th>\n<th width=\"20%\">2 Star\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deer\" title=\"Deer\"><img alt=\"Deer\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/2/27/Deer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20220212232651\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Deer.png\" data-image-key=\"Deer.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deer\" title=\"Deer\">Deer</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">4\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">8\n</td></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeer_Meat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Crafting\">Crafting</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeer_Meat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%