th=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Coal.png\" data-image-key=\"Coal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a>, if left on a Cooking station for too long</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"For_Cooked_deer_meat\">For Cooked deer meat</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeer_Meat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deer_stew\" title=\"Deer stew\"><img alt=\"Deer Stew\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Deer Stew.png\" data-image-key=\"Deer_Stew.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/0/0e/Deer_Stew.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210927004723\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Deer_stew\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deer stew\">Deer stew</a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whole_roasted_Meadow_boar\" title=\"Whole roasted Meadow boar\"><img alt=\"Whole Roasted Meadow Boar\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Whole Roasted Meadow Boar.png\" data-image-key=\"Whole_Roasted_Meadow_Boar.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/4/4b/Whole_Roasted_Meadow_Boar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20241019120434\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Whole_roasted_Meadow_boar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Whole roasted Meadow boar\">Whole roasted Meadow boar</a></li></ul>\n<p>Unlike most other foods made from meat, Deer meat has to be cooked on a Cooking station first to be crafted into other foods.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Show\" data-collapsetext=\"Hide\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-title\"><th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\"><span class=\"navbox-vde\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:FoodsNav\" title=\"Template:FoodsNav\"><span title=\"View this navbox template\">v</span></a> · <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:FoodsNav\"><span title=\"Discuss this navbox template\">d</span></a> · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.fandom.com/wiki/Template:FoodsNav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this navbox template\">e</span></a></span></span><div class=\"navbox-title-pad navbox-title-padleft navbox-title-padright\"><a href=\"/wiki/Food\" title=\"Food\">Food</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Mead\" title=\"Mead\">meads</a></div></th></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\"><a href=\"/wiki/Food\" title=\"Food\">Food</a></th><td class=\"navbox-list\" style=\"background: none\"><div class=\"hlist\"></div><table class=\"navbox-subgroup\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\"><a href=\"/wiki/Meadows\" title=\"Meadows\">Meadows</a></th><td class=\"navbox-list\" style=\"background: none\"><div class=\